.TH start-cli-server-nut-list-ups 1  "nut-list-ups "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-nut\-list\-ups \- List the UPS devices a NUT server serves
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server nut\-list\-ups\fR [\fB\-\-port\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIHOST\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the UPS devices a NUT server serves
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-port\fR \fI<PORT>\fR [default: 3493]
NUT server port
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIHOST\fR>
NUT server hostname or IP address
